00:06:16.803 --> 00:06:19.540
<v Host>Quiz time. Three questions.

00:06:20.139 --> 00:06:25.803
<v Slow>青森県の地震の大きさはどのくらいですか。

00:06:26.603 --> 00:06:32.315
<v Host>What was the size of the earthquake in Aomori? Answer: Magnitude 6.2.

00:06:32.915 --> 00:06:38.555
