00:06:39.355 --> 00:06:45.211
<v Host>How much did the Nikkei average stock price rise? Answer: More than 2,000 yen.

00:06:45.812 --> 00:06:53.851
<v Slow>ワールドカップでモロッコはハイチとの試合でいくつの点を入れましたか。

00:06:54.651 --> 00:07:01.348
<v Host>How many points did Morocco score against Haiti in the World Cup game? Answer: Five points in total.

